## Access model (PWA — required follow-up)

Landing is open signup. **PWA-signal-plus-v2** must match:

1. **Remove whitelist gate** — do not block login/signup based on `/admin` whitelist.
2. **Auto VIP lifetime** — on `POST /api/auth/request`, create/update user with `lifetime: true` (same fix applied manually for Kim and the second VIP user).
3. **Backfill existing users** — SQL or script: set `lifetime = true` for all users (health endpoint showed ~8 users).
4. **Remove referral UI** from app settings/onboarding; stop requiring `referredByCode`.
5. **Retire `/api/admin/whitelist`** and admin whitelist page (or leave read-only for audit only).
6. **Settings** — hide “Manage subscription” unless `has_stripe_subscription && !lifetime` (already how production bundle behaves).

Open **PWA-signal-plus-v2** in a Cloud Agent to implement — this landing repo cannot push there.

